Adds `vikunja` to the hand-maintained AppList enum that GET /v1/apps is derived from.
Without this the Console never shows the tile, whatever core.yaml says.

diff --git a/src/openapi/app.yaml b/src/openapi/app.yaml
index 8f5d805..3706ba5 100644
--- a/src/openapi/app.yaml
+++ b/src/openapi/app.yaml
@@ -25,6 +25,7 @@ AppList:
     - tekton
     - sealed-secrets
     - trivy
+    - vikunja
 
 App:
   x-acl:
